              "Specifically, President Donald Trump tweeted that Chinese buyers had already started purchasing American agricultural products and didn’t wait until the signing of the deal, which is due to three or four weeks",
              "### EU approval paves way for Beijing Convention to enter into force on 15 December\nI agreed not to increase Tariffs from 25% to 30% on October 15th. They will remain at 25%. The relationship with China is very good. We will finish out the large Phase One part of the deal, then head directly into Phase Two. The Phase One Deal can be finalized & signed soon!",
